# LumenPDF

SwiftUI + PDFKit（macOS 15+）→ UniFFI → Rust（interfaces / domain / infrastructure）。TTS 在 Swift 本地。翻译：SQLite 缓存 → LLM → MyMemory。

```
Swift UI  →  BridgeService  →  UniFFI  →  interfaces  →  domain ← infrastructure
```

| 层 | 目录 | 约束 |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Swift | `LumenPDF/` | 不直接 SQLite/HTTP；跨语言走 `BridgeService` |
| interfaces | `src/interfaces/` | UniFFI export + 组装依赖 |
| domain | `src/domain/` | 零 I/O |
| infrastructure | `src/infrastructure/` | 实现 domain traits |

规格：`docs/product.md`、`docs/architecture.md`、`docs/history.md`。构建：`scripts/build-rust.sh`。桥：`LumenPDF/Services/BridgeService.swift`、`lumen-pdf-core/src/interfaces/api.rs`。
